DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaxxppppmmiicc driver provides support for the X-Powers AXP Power Management
     ICs.  Depending on the model, these devices have temperature, voltage and
     current sensors and power indicators.  Sensor values are made available
     through the sysctl(8) interface.

